f Oman. Iran claims that the tankers were on fire after hitting the mines. This incident occurred on October 29, 2026. The Strait of Hormuz is a crucial shipping route for oil and other goods.","text_hi":null,"model":"qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-q4_k_m.gguf","created_at":"2026-10-30T20:53:51Z"},"context":{"background":[{"title":"Strait of Hormuz","extract":"The Strait of Hormuz is a waterway between the Persian Gulf and the Gulf of Oman. On the north coast lies Iran, and on the south coast lies the Musandam Peninsula under the Musandam Governorate of Oman, with a portion of the southwest of the peninsula under the United Arab Emirates (UAE). The strait is about 104 miles long, with a width varying from about 60 mi to 24 mi.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Strait_of_Hormuz","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"places":[{"title":"Iran","extract":"Iran, officially the Islamic Republic of Iran, and historically known as Persia, is a country in West Asia. It borders Iraq to the west; Turkey, Azerbaijan, and Armenia to the northwest; the Caspian Sea to the north, Turkmenistan to the northeast; Afghanistan to the east; Pakistan to the southeast; and the Gulf of Oman and the Persian Gulf to the south. With a population of over 92 million, Iran ranks 17th globally in both geographic size and population. It is divided into five regions with 31 provinces. Tehran is the nation's capital and largest city and serves as its primary economic center.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iran","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"IR"},{"title":"United States","extract":"The United States of America (USA), also known as the United States (U.S.) or America, is a country primarily located in North America. It is a federal republic consisting of 50 states and a federal capital district, Washington, D.C. The 48 contiguous states border Canada to the north and Mexico to the south, with the semi-exclave of Alaska in the northwest and the archipelago of Hawaii in the Pacific Ocean. The United States also asserts sovereignty over five major island territories and various uninhabited islands in Oceania and the Caribbean. It is a megadiverse country, with the world's fourth-largest total area and third-largest population, exceeding 341 million.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"US"}],"arc":{"reports":219,"first_seen":"2026-10-09T18:01:09Z","first_title":"Tanker attacks in Strait of Hormuz surge to wartime high as Iran tries to choke off oil exports","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQLXQ5SXNEMzB0UFVEM09pZjB6S29PbXBPZWdwQ1VUei1iSkJ4RWx6d0pvOUhRVXdiVTZKeHUzUkVVSUE5bmtENm5OOXFrN24zYjhYdlN5R1VfckRfaGt3eXJlLXVNSFR6OE5lTTdWT19mRGVRNDQ5QTltV09OdXdSd2h6cw?oc=5","first_publisher":"CNBC","earlier":[{"id":"e_91b00c293b1b","title":"Oil spills from tankers attacked by Iran in Hormuz reach UAE coastline, report says","date":"2026-10-31T07:58:00Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOdzNWTjAzOGNFaHFtV2prSlhrNFVWMjJkYURxRzVfbG5CczFRX1FXMnhJQW5OSzhvc1kwdmVUTTFyXzl6Y2ZjeS00SldoY25jUjNNa3JPYjBRU21TQUJYQ3NSbHI3VGJsdGQzVEFRVldWY3JNdW43QUhKbWJtM092aXRVWFNaVHVQLUNvdEFZYXJzenZ5dEExY2hhNE8weHFuU3FRbVZXdk56dF9VMjVPNFg4Ykc3UF94R3hkWVNJOFUtVl96bHlr?oc=5","publisher":"Middle East Eye","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_4d4203d90102","title":"Iran's Sea Mine Threat Raises Alarm In Hormuz As 8 Vessels Reportedly Hit | Shipping At Risk","date":"2026-10-31T08:25:56Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","publisher":"The Times of India","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_03f2992bcf22","title":"Saudi Arabia and Yemen Warn of Iran-Backed Houthi Threat to Hormuz, Bab el-Mandeb Shipping","date":"2026-10-31T10:31:05Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNVDNOM0tQWmtCOFFQQVlPRGxNUUQ1dzkwOWxOdGFpLW9EX0Rta0stc195SjVwMlJsNHBTTTIxRFA4U0RPeHpCa3JOZDRRbG1LN05ZZ0hSdko3cFNUV2dRYlZM